 "about": "Deck structures for the picker's first step and for planning a deck. Each slide is [goal, layout, surface]. Layouts name the kit's shells and components (see layouts, with an example slide in samples/showcase.html); surfaces are base, alt, accent, inverse or image. A long deck changes rhythm at about a third and two thirds of the way through (a statement, big number, full-bleed picture or inverse surface). Themes listed that are not built yet are skipped by the picker.",
